{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "hub.hallmark",
  "kind": "skill",
  "name": "Hallmark",
  "summary": "Anti-AI-slop design skill for greenfield pages: a default design flow plus three in-skill verbs the model performs when the user asks - audit (read the target, score it against the anti-pattern list, report only, never edit), redesign (re-visualize inside the existing implementation boundaries, preserving routes, copy intent and information architecture), and study (extract the design DNA from a screenshot or a URL the user supplies). These verbs are skill behaviors, not installed CLI commands. Inputs: a design brief, an existing page or component, or a screenshot/URL to study; output is HTML/CSS artifacts with locked design tokens, verified at 320/375/414/768 px. Carried verbatim from nutlope/hallmark at the pinned commit; only the skill directory (SKILL.md plus references) is carried, not the site/docs/demo.",
  "summaryI18n": {
    "zh-CN": "反 AI 味设计技能，用于全新页面：默认设计流 + 三个由模型在会话内执行的动词 —— audit（只读评分、输出问题清单、绝不改文件）、redesign（在既有实现边界内重做视觉层，保留路由/文案意图/信息架构）、study（从用户提供的截图或 URL 提取设计 DNA）。这些动词是技能行为，不是安装的 CLI 命令。输入：设计简报、既有页面或组件、待研究的截图/URL；输出为带锁定设计 token 的 HTML/CSS，并在 320/375/414/768 px 四档验证。自 nutlope/hallmark 钉住 commit 逐字携带，仅携带技能目录（SKILL.md 与 references），不含 site/docs/demo。"
  },
  "authors": [
